# Cloudflare Workers static-asset redirects.
#
# zudo-doc 5.8+ accepts this site's nested `entryDocSlug`
# (`overview/getting-started`) directly, so the Docs links emitted by
# /docs/versions/ already resolve to their canonical EN/JA latest and archived
# destinations.
#
# Claude resources are generated from the live repo into the default docs
# directory only. The header marks Claude as `versioned: false`, and current
# version switchers disable every absent Claude-family archive destination.
#
# Legacy/bookmarked `/v/:version/docs/claude*` aliases are intentionally
# retired: those paths claim to identify archive content that was never
# shipped. Redirecting them to latest would silently relabel current content
# as an archive, so they remain 404s by design.
